@startuml
title Proposed run states; child milestone completion remains separate
[*] --> PLANNED
PLANNED --> RECONCILING
RECONCILING --> PREPARING_DESIGN : consistent eligible scope
RECONCILING --> RECOVERY_REQUIRED : uncertain child operation
PREPARING_DESIGN --> AWAITING_APPROVAL
AWAITING_APPROVAL --> PLANNING_TASKS : requirements and validated design approved
PLANNING_TASKS --> AWAITING_APPROVAL : plan / execution authority missing
PLANNING_TASKS --> EXECUTING : all exact gates pass
EXECUTING --> VERIFYING : observed child results
VERIFYING --> EXECUTING : bounded permitted repair
VERIFYING --> PREPARING_DELIVERY : independent quality accepted
PREPARING_DELIVERY --> AWAITING_APPROVAL : privileged grant missing
PREPARING_DELIVERY --> OBSERVING_DELIVERY : authorized child operation
OBSERVING_DELIVERY --> REPORTED : bounded observation/report
EXECUTING --> PAUSED : budget / operator pause
OBSERVING_DELIVERY --> PAUSED : polling budget
PAUSED --> RECONCILING : explicit resume
RECOVERY_REQUIRED --> RECONCILING : verified recovery
RECONCILING --> BLOCKED : conflict / unknown authority
BLOCKED --> RECONCILING : evidence changed
REPORTED --> [*]
@enduml
